{"meta":{"cloudId":"pxt/microbit","editor":"blocksprj","name":"Teachable Labor Schuelerprogramm"},"source":"{\"pxt.json\":\"{\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"Teachable Labor Schuelerprogramm\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"Aendere nur die Aktionen in den zehn Zahl-Ereignissen. USB und Bluetooth sind in der Teachable-Labor-Erweiterung verborgen.\\\",\\n    \\\"dependencies\\\": {\\n        \\\"core\\\": \\\"*\\\",\\n        \\\"teachable-labor\\\": \\\"github:makl72/microbit-kameralabor#7993780b4b4223868ef8f44c5bd6f24fffc82db1\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"files\\\": [\\n        \\\"main.blocks\\\",\\n        \\\"main.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"README.md\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"supportedTargets\\\": [\\n        \\\"microbit\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"preferredEditor\\\": \\\"blocksprj\\\",\\n    \\\"yotta\\\": {\\n        \\\"config\\\": {\\n            \\\"microbit-dal\\\": {\\n                \\\"bluetooth\\\": {\\n                    \\\"open\\\": 1,\\n                    \\\"whitelist\\\": 0,\\n                    \\\"security_level\\\": null\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n    }\\n}\",\"main.blocks\":\"<xml xmlns=\\\"https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml\\\">\\n<variables></variables>\\n  <block type=\\\"teachable_labor_on_1\\\" x=\\\"20\\\" y=\\\"20\\\">\\n    <statement name=\\\"HANDLER\\\">\\n      <block type=\\\"device_show_number\\\">\\n        <value name=\\\"number\\\">\\n          <shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\">1</field></shadow>\\n        </value>\\n      </block>\\n    </statement>\\n  </block>\\n  <block type=\\\"teachable_labor_on_2\\\" x=\\\"20\\\" y=\\\"155\\\">\\n    <statement name=\\\"HANDLER\\\">\\n      <block type=\\\"device_show_number\\\">\\n        <value name=\\\"number\\\">\\n          <shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\">2</field></shadow>\\n        </value>\\n      </block>\\n    </statement>\\n  </block>\\n  <block type=\\\"teachable_labor_on_3\\\" x=\\\"20\\\" y=\\\"290\\\">\\n    <statement name=\\\"HANDLER\\\">\\n      <block type=\\\"device_show_number\\\">\\n        <value name=\\\"number\\\">\\n          <shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\">3</field></shadow>\\n        </value>\\n      </block>\\n    </statement>\\n  </block>\\n  <block type=\\\"teachable_labor_on_4\\\" x=\\\"20\\\" y=\\\"425\\\">\\n    <statement name=\\\"HANDLER\\\">\\n      <block type=\\\"device_show_number\\\">\\n        <value name=\\\"number\\\">\\n          <shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\">4</field></shadow>\\n        </value>\\n      </block>\\n    </statement>\\n  </block>\\n  <block type=\\\"teachable_labor_on_5\\\" x=\\\"20\\\" y=\\\"560\\\">\\n    <statement name=\\\"HANDLER\\\">\\n      <block type=\\\"device_show_number\\\">\\n        <value name=\\\"number\\\">\\n          <shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\">5</field></shadow>\\n        </value>\\n      </block>\\n    </statement>\\n  </block>\\n  <block type=\\\"teachable_labor_on_6\\\" x=\\\"430\\\" y=\\\"20\\\">\\n    <statement name=\\\"HANDLER\\\">\\n      <block type=\\\"device_show_number\\\">\\n        <value name=\\\"number\\\">\\n          <shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\">6</field></shadow>\\n        </value>\\n      </block>\\n    </statement>\\n  </block>\\n  <block type=\\\"teachable_labor_on_7\\\" x=\\\"430\\\" y=\\\"155\\\">\\n    <statement name=\\\"HANDLER\\\">\\n      <block type=\\\"device_show_number\\\">\\n        <value name=\\\"number\\\">\\n          <shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\">7</field></shadow>\\n        </value>\\n      </block>\\n    </statement>\\n  </block>\\n  <block type=\\\"teachable_labor_on_8\\\" x=\\\"430\\\" y=\\\"290\\\">\\n    <statement name=\\\"HANDLER\\\">\\n      <block type=\\\"device_show_number\\\">\\n        <value name=\\\"number\\\">\\n          <shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\">8</field></shadow>\\n        </value>\\n      </block>\\n    </statement>\\n  </block>\\n  <block type=\\\"teachable_labor_on_9\\\" x=\\\"430\\\" y=\\\"425\\\">\\n    <statement name=\\\"HANDLER\\\">\\n      <block type=\\\"device_show_number\\\">\\n        <value name=\\\"number\\\">\\n          <shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\">9</field></shadow>\\n        </value>\\n      </block>\\n    </statement>\\n  </block>\\n  <block type=\\\"teachable_labor_on_10\\\" x=\\\"430\\\" y=\\\"560\\\">\\n    <statement name=\\\"HANDLER\\\">\\n      <block type=\\\"device_show_number\\\">\\n        <value name=\\\"number\\\">\\n          <shadow type=\\\"math_number\\\"><field name=\\\"NUM\\\">10</field></shadow>\\n        </value>\\n      </block>\\n    </statement>\\n  </block>\\n</xml>\",\"main.ts\":\"teachableLabor.on1(function () {\\n    basic.showNumber(1)\\n})\\n\\nteachableLabor.on2(function () {\\n    basic.showNumber(2)\\n})\\n\\nteachableLabor.on3(function () {\\n    basic.showNumber(3)\\n})\\n\\nteachableLabor.on4(function () {\\n    basic.showNumber(4)\\n})\\n\\nteachableLabor.on5(function () {\\n    basic.showNumber(5)\\n})\\n\\nteachableLabor.on6(function () {\\n    basic.showNumber(6)\\n})\\n\\nteachableLabor.on7(function () {\\n    basic.showNumber(7)\\n})\\n\\nteachableLabor.on8(function () {\\n    basic.showNumber(8)\\n})\\n\\nteachableLabor.on9(function () {\\n    basic.showNumber(9)\\n})\\n\\nteachableLabor.on10(function () {\\n    basic.showNumber(10)\\n})\\n\",\"README.md\":\"# Teachable Labor – Schülerprogramm\\n\\nDie Kamera-App sendet die Zahlen 1 bis 10.\\n\\nIm Blockeditor siehst du zehn Ereignisse:\\n- wenn Zahl 1 empfangen\\n- ...\\n- wenn Zahl 10 empfangen\\n\\nÄndere nur die Blöcke innerhalb dieser Ereignisse. Die Verbindung über USB oder Bluetooth wird automatisch von der Erweiterung „Teachable Labor“ übernommen.\\n\"}"}